			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 413590101,
					"content": "欢迎试玩「玲珑霄灯图」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413590102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小千"
				},
				{
					"id": 413590102,
					"content": "这次也准备了不一样的图案吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413590103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 413590103,
					"content": "当然啦，毕竟被你连续解开了两次，这次我可是真的去换了难度最高的几盏灯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413590104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小千"
				},
				{
					"id": 413590104,
					"content": "不过，图当然还是三个拼成一个完整的，难度还是在<color=#00E1FFFF>「连轴」</color>上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413590105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小千"
				},
				{
					"id": 413590105,
					"content": "嘿嘿，你就自己去体会一下吧，这次的图案是<color=#00E1FFFF>「仙鹤」</color>哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						413590106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小千"
				},
				{
					"id": 413590106,
					"content": "拼好了图之后，你就可以去找宝藏去啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "小千"
				}
			]
		},
